---
description: TaskHub Project Standards & Development Principles
alwaysApply: true
---

- All work must follow TDD (Red-Green-Refactor).
- Use PNPM for all dependency management and scripts.
- All code must pass CI quality gates: dependency sync, type checking, linting, and tests.
- Monorepo structure: apps/web (frontend), apps/api (backend), packages/shared (types/utilities).
- Tech stack: React 19, Next.js 15.3, TypeScript 5.6, TanStack Query, Zustand, Shadcn/ui, Tailwind, ASP.NET Core 9, EF Core 9, PostgreSQL, SignalR.
- Key patterns: RESTful APIs, JWT auth, server components, optimistic UI, repository pattern, snake_case DB columns.